<messaging:emailTemplate subject=" {!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_Client_Name__c} ({!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_ClientNo__c}) - Payroll Summary  " recipientType="User" relatedToType="Implementation_Profile__c">
<messaging:HtmlEmailBody >
<html>
<body>
<c:InsperityEmailHeader ></c:InsperityEmailHeader>

<p style="color: #FF0000">INSTRUCTIONS: Please read through the email summary and edit as needed for this client. Create a new <br/>
 email to the Payroll Contact. Copy and paste everything below the red line from this email into the new <br/>
 email to the Payroll Contact.</p>
<p style="color: #FF0000">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p>
 
<p> Dear {!relatedTo.NSP_PC_Client_Name__c},</p>

<p>Thank you for your time today. As we discussed, there are a few items we need to take care of <br/>
in order to ensure your payroll is in compliance and that your employees’ paychecks are accurate.</p>

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(CONTAINS(relatedTo.Client_have_any_EEs_on_F1_or_J1_Visa_s__c,'Yes'),
                             OR(IF(relatedTo.NSP_EE_Name__c!=Null,True,FALSE),
                             IF(relatedTo.EE_Visa_Type__c!=Null,True,FALSE)))}">
<p>You have indicated the following employees are on a F1 or J1 visa. Please send copies of the <br/>
visa(s) to me so we can exempt them from withholding taxes. I will need the copies prior to <br/>
running your first payroll to ensure their taxes are correct on their first paycheck from Insperity. </p>
<c:NSP_EmployeeVisaCmp currentRecordId="{!relatedTo.Id}"/>
</apex:outputPanel>

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(CONTAINS(relatedTo.Do_any_EEs_have_garnishments__c,'Yes'),
                             IF(relatedTo.NSP_Employee_Names_List_garnishments__c!=Null,True,FALSE))}">
<p>Please provide the most recent copy of the garnishments for the following employees. I will need the copies <br/>
prior to running your first payroll to ensure the garnishments are properly deducted. </p>
<c:NSP_EmployeeGarnishmentCmp currentRecordId="{!relatedTo.Id}"/>
</apex:outputPanel>

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!AND(CONTAINS(relatedTo.Do_any_EEs_have_tax_levies__c,'Yes'),
                             IF(relatedTo.NSP_List_Employee_Names_Levies__c!=Null,True,FALSE))}">
<p>The following employees have Tax Levies that will need to be transferred to Insperity’s <br/>
name so that we can process them. Please complete the page/form provided by the levying agency <br/>
that shows you are no longer paying wages to the employee. Give Insperity’s corporate office information <br/>
listed below and return it to the agency.</p>

<p>Revised levy needs to be sent to:
Insperity
Attn: Garnishment Department
19001 Crescent Springs Dr.
Kingwood, TX 77339
Fax Number: 866-309-1267</p>

<p>Once we receive the levy in Insperity’s name we will begin processing it.
<c:NSP_EmployeeLeviesCmp currentRecordId="{!relatedTo.Id}"/>
</p>

</apex:outputPanel>

<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!OR(CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'CT'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'DE'),
CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'IL'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'IA'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'KY'),
CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'ME'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'MA'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'MS'),
CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'NV'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'ND'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'OH'),
CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'RI'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'SD'),CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'VT'))}">
<p><b>State Unemployment Taxes</b> </p>

<p> You indicated there are employees working in the following states that have specific <br/>
rules on filing state unemployment taxes. Please review the section State <br/>
Unemployment Taxes on the <apex:outputLink value="https://portal.insperity.com/pcms/payroll_tax_guidelines" target="_parent"> Payroll Tax Guidelines page</apex:outputLink> on Insperity Premier
for additional details.</p>


 <ul>
<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'CT')}">
<li>Connecticut</li>
</apex:outputPanel>
<apex:outputPanel rendered="{!CONTAINS(relatedTo.Employees_work_in_the_following_states__c ,'DE')}">
<li>Delaware</li>
</apex:outputPanel>
